package"},{"id":"book an appointment","text":"book an appointment"},{"id":"rent a car","text":"rent a car"},{"id":"buy an envelope","text":"buy an envelope"}]}},{"role":"listenRepeat","exercise":{"version":1,"id":"A22M6L2-M03","kind":"audio","title":"Listen and repeat","layout":"listen-repeat","audioPending":false,"items":[{"id":"1","text":"send a package","audioId":"A22M6L2_M03-WORD-1","audio":"https://xpeywyonbapnvtjnwawi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/course-audio/a2-2/w6/l2/listen-repeat/M03-WORD-1.mp3?v=20261011-clips-realigned-r3","example":"Ben needs to send a package to his sister.","exampleAudioId":"A22M6L2_M03-EXAMPLE-1","exampleAudio":"https://xpeywyonbapnvtjnwawi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/course-audio/a2-2/w6/l2/listen-repeat/M03-EXAMPLE-1.mp3?v=20261011-clips-realigned-r3"},{"id":"2","text":"buy an envelope","audioId":"A22M6L2_M03-WORD-2","audio":"https://xpeywyonbapnvtjnwawi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/course-audio/a2-2/w6/l2/listen-repeat/M03-WORD-2.mp3?v=20261011-clips-realigned-r3","example":"Can we buy an envelope here?","exampleAudioId":"A22M6L2_M03-EXAMPLE-2","exampleAudio":"https://xpeywyonbapnvtjnwawi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/course-audio/a2-2/w6/l2/listen-repeat/M03-EXAMPLE-2.mp3?v=20261011-clips-realigned-r3"},{"id":"3","text":"buy medicine","audioId":"A22M6L2_M03-WORD-3","audio":"https://xpeywyonbapnvtjnwawi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/course-audio/a2-2/w6/l2/listen-repeat/M03-WORD-3.mp3?v=20261011-clips-realigned-r3","example":"Laura wants to buy medicine for her cold.","exampleAudioId":"A22M6L2_M03-EXAMPLE-3","exampleAudio":"https://xpeywyonbapnvtjnwawi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/course-audio/a2-2/w6/l2/listen-repeat/M03-EXAMPLE-3.mp3?v=20261011-clips-realigned-r3"},{"id":"4","text":"rent a car","audioId":"A22M6L2_M03-WORD-4","audio":"https://xpeywyonbapnvtjnwawi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/course-audio/a2-2/w6/l2/listen-repeat/M03-WORD-4.mp3?v=20261011-clips-realigned-r3","example":"My parents want to rent a car for the weekend.","exampleAudioId":"A22M6L2_M03-EXAMPLE-4","exampleAudio":"https://xpeywyonbapnvtjnwawi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/course-audio/a2-2/w6/l2/listen-repeat/M03-EXAMPLE-4.mp3?v=20261011-clips-realigned-r3"},{"id":"5","text":"book an appointment","audioId":"A22M6L2_M03-WORD-5","audio":"https://xpeywyonbapnvtjnwawi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/course-audio/a2-2/w6/l2/listen-repeat/M03-WORD-5.mp3?v=20261011-clips-realigned-r3","example":"You can book an appointment by phone.","exampleAudioId":"A22M6L2_M03-EXAMPLE-5","exampleAudio":"https://xpeywyonbapnvtjnwawi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/course-audio/a2-2/w6/l2/listen-repeat/M03-EXAMPLE-5.mp3?v=20261011-clips-realigned-r3"},{"id":"6","text":"make a photocopy","audioId":"A22M6L2_M03-WORD-6","audio":"https://xpeywyonbapnvtjnwawi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/course-audio/a2-2/w6/l2/listen-repeat/M03-WORD-6.mp3?v=20261011-clips-realigned-r3","example":"I need to make a photocopy of this page.","exampleAudioId":"A22M6L2_M03-EXAMPLE-6","exampleAudio":"https://xpeywyonbapnvtjnwawi.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/course-audio/a2-2/w6/l2/listen-repeat/M03-EXAMPLE-6.mp3?v=20261011-clips-realigned-r3"}]}},{"role":"practice","exercise":{"version":1,"id":"A22M6L2-M04","kind":"gaps","title":"A busy morning","instruction":"Complete the sentences.","inputMode":"text","bank":["make a photocopy","buy medicine","send a package","book an appointment","rent a car","buy an envelope"],"items":[{"id":"1","segments":["My aunt lives in another city. I want to ",{"id":"1","answers":["send a package"]}," with her birthday present inside."]},{"id":"2","segments":["We''re only here for two days. We want to ",{"id":"2","answers":["rent a car"]}," so we can drive to the beach."]},{"id":"3","segments":["I need to ",{"id":"3","answers":["buy an envelope"]}," before I can send this letter."]},{"id":"4","segments":["The dentist can see me on Tuesday. I need to call and ",{"id":"4","answers":["book an appointment"]},"."]},{"id":"5","segments":["This is my only copy of the form, and the hotel needs a copy too. Can I ",{"id":"5","answers":["make a photocopy"]}," here?"]},{"id":"6","segments":["My cold is worse today. I need to ",{"id":"6","answers":["buy medicine"]},"."]}]}},{"role":"rule","exercise":{"version":1,"id":"A22M6L2-M06","kind":"rule-page","title":"Somewhere, anywhere, everywhere, nowhere","blocks":[{"type":"text","text":"We use somewhere when there is a place, but we do not say which place.\n\nI know somewhere to buy an envelope.","highlights":["somewhere"]},{"type":"text","text":"We often use anywhere in questions when we do not know the answer. We also use it with not when we cannot find a place. Somewhere is also possible in questions, especially when we think there is a place.\n\nIs there anywhere to rent a car near here?\nI can''t find anywhere to rent a car.","highlights":["anywhere","not","Somewhere"]},{"type":"text","text":"Everywhere means all the places we are talking about. Nowhere means no place.\n\nI looked everywhere in the hotel.\nThere''s nowhere in this hotel to make a photocopy.","highlights":["Everywhere","Nowhere","everywhere","nowhere"]},{"type":"text","text":"Nowhere already means “no place”, so do not add not. We can say the same thing with not + anywhere.\n\nThere''s nowhere to make a photocopy here.\nThere isn''t anywhere to make a photocopy here.","highlights":["Nowhere","not + anywhere","nowhere","isn''t anywhere"]},{"type":"text","text":"When we say what we want to do in a place, we use somewhere / anywhere / nowhere + to + verb.\n\nWe need somewhere to buy medicine.\nIs there anywhere to book an appointment?","highlights":["somewhere / anywhere / nowhere + to + verb","somewhere to buy","anywhere to book"]},{"type":"text","text":"These words already tell us about a place. Say go somewhere and look everywhere, without adding to or in before the place word. The to in somewhere to buy medicine goes with the action buy.\n\nWe still use look for to mean “try to find”: I’m looking for somewhere to rent a car. We can also add details: somewhere in town, anywhere near the station.","highlights":["go somewhere","look everywhere","look for","for somewhere","somewhere","anywhere"]}]}},{"role":"practice","exercise":{"version":1,"id":"A22M6L2-M09","kind":"gaps","title":"Can I do it here?","instruction":"Choose the correct words.","inputMode":"select","items":[{"id":"1","segments":["There are three shops in this shopping center. I asked in all three. I asked ",{"id":"1","answers":["everywhere"],"options":["nowhere","everywhere","anywhere"]}," in the shopping center."]},{"id":"2","segments":["I didn''t find ",{"id":"2","answers":["anywhere"],"options":["anywhere","nowhere","everywhere"]}," to rent a car for less than $80 a day."]},{"id":"3","segments":["There''s ",{"id":"3","answers":["somewhere"],"options":["in somewhere","to somewhere","somewhere"]}," to buy medicine near my office. I can show you."]},{"id":"4","segments":["There''s nowhere ",{"id":"4","answers":["to buy"],"options":["buying","to buy","buy"]}," an envelope in this hotel. Let''s go to the post office."]}]}},{"role":"translation","exercise":{"version":1,"id":"A22M6L2-HW-1-1","kind":"writing","title":"Translate into English · 1.1","instruction":"Переведи предложение на английский.","responseMode":"accepted","revealPossibleAnswers":false,"items":[{"id":"1","prompt":"Мне нужно где-нибудь отправить посылку.","normalization":"translation","acceptedAnswers":["I need somewhere to send a package.","I need to find somewhere to send a package.","I need a place to send a package."]}]}},{"role":"translation","exercise":{"version":1,"id":"A22M6L2-HW-1-2","kind":"writing","title":"Translate into English · 1.2","instruction":"Переведи предложение на английский.","responseMode":"accepted","revealPossibleAnswers":false,"items":[{"id":"1","prompt":"Здесь есть где-нибудь место, где можно купить конверт?","normalization":"translation","acceptedAnswers":["Is there anywhere here to buy an envelope?","Is there anywhere to buy an envelope here?","Is there somewhere here to buy an envelope?","Is there somewhere to buy an envelope here?","Is there anywhere here where I can buy an envelope?","Is there a place here where I can buy an envelope?"]}]}},{"role":"translation","exercise":{"version":1,"id":"A22M6L2-HW-1-3","kind":"writing","title":"Translate into English · 1.3","instruction":"Переведи предложение на английский.","responseMode":"accepted","revealPossibleAnswers":false,"items":[{"id":"1","prompt":"Я нигде не могу купить лекарство.","normalization":"translation","acceptedAnswers":["I cannot buy medicine anywhere.","I cannot find anywhere to buy medicine.","There is nowhere I can buy medicine.","I can buy medicine nowhere.","there''s nowhere I can buy medicine.","I can''t buy medicine anywhere.","I can''t find anywhere to buy medicine."]}]}},{"role":"translation","exercise":{"version":1,"id":"A22M6L2-HW-1-4","kind":"writing","title":"Translate into English · 1.4","instruction":"Переведи предложение на английский.","responseMode":"accepted","revealPossibleAnswers":false,"items":[{"id":"1","prompt":"Здесь негде арендовать машину.","normalization":"translation","acceptedAnswers":["There is nowhere to rent a car here.","There is not anywhere to rent a car here.","I cannot rent a car anywhere here.","there''s nowhere to rent a car here.","there''s not anywhere to rent a car here.","there isn''t anywhere to rent a car here.","There isn''t anywhere to rent a car here.","I can''t rent a car anywhere here."]}]}},{"role":"translation","exercise":{"version":1,"id":"A22M6L2-HW-1-5","kind":"writing","title":"Translate into English · 1.5","instruction":"Переведи предложение на английский.","responseMode":"accepted","revealPossibleAnswers":false,"items":[{"id":"1","prompt":"Я искала место для этой услуги везде.","normalization":"translation","acceptedAnswers":["I looked everywhere for a place that offers this service.","I looked everywhere for a place to get this service.","I searched everywhere for a place that offers this service.","I looked everywhere for this service.","I searched everywhere for this service."]}]}},{"role":"translation","exercise":{"version":1,"id":"A22M6L2-HW-2-1","kind":"writing","title":"Translate into English · 2.1","instruction":"Переведи предложение на английский.","responseMode":"accepted","revealPossibleAnswers":false,"items":[{"id":"1","prompt":"Мы нашли место, где можно сделать ксерокопию.","normalization":"translation","acceptedAnswers":["We found somewhere to make a photocopy.","We found a place to make a photocopy.","We found somewhere we can make a photocopy.","We found a place where we can make a photocopy.","We found somewhere to get a photocopy."]}]}},{"role":"translation","exercise":{"version":1,"id":"A22M6L2-HW-2-2","kind":"writing","title":"Translate into English · 2.2","instruction":"Переведи предложение на английский.","responseMode":"accepted","revealPossibleAnswers":false,"items":[{"id":"1","prompt":"Ты знаешь где-нибудь место, где можно записаться на приём?","normalization":"translation","acceptedAnswers":["Do you know anywhere to book an appointment?","Do you know somewhere to book an appointment?","Do you know a place where I can book an appointment?","Do you know anywhere I can book an appointment?"]}]}},{"role":"translation","exercise":{"version":1,"id":"A22M6L2-HW-2-3","kind":"writing","title":"Translate into English · 2.3","instruction":"Переведи предложение на английский.","responseMode":"accepted","revealPossibleAnswers":false,"items":[{"id":"1","prompt":"Я не могу найти нигде место, где можно отправить посылку.","normalization":"translation","acceptedAnswers":["I cannot find anywhere to send a package.","I cannot find a place where I can send a package.","I can find nowhere to send a package.","I cannot find a place to send a package anywhere.","I can''t find anywhere to send a package.","I can''t find a place where I can send a package.","I can''t find a place to send a package anywhere."]}]}},{"role":"translation","exercise":{"version":1,"id":"A22M6L2-HW-2-4","kind":"writing","title":"Translate into English · 2.4","instruction":"Переведи предложение на английский.","responseMode":"accepted","revealPossibleAnswers":false,"items":[{"id":"1","prompt":"В этом районе везде можно купить конверты.","normalization":"translation","acceptedAnswers":["You can buy envelopes everywhere in this area.","In this area, you can buy envelopes everywhere.","Envelopes are sold everywhere in this area.","There are places to buy envelopes everywhere in this area."]}]}},{"role":"translation","exercise":{"version":1,"id":"A22M6L2-HW-2-5","kind":"writing","title":"Translate into English · 2.5","instruction":"Переведи предложение на английский.","responseMode":"accepted","revealPossibleAnswers":false,"items":[{"id":"1","prompt":"Рядом с нашим отелем негде купить лекарство.","normalization":"translation","acceptedAnswers":["There is nowhere to buy medicine near our hotel.","There is not anywhere to buy medicine near our hotel.","We cannot buy medicine anywhere near our hotel.","there''s nowhere to buy medicine near our hotel.","there''s not anywhere to buy medicine near our hotel.","there isn''t anywhere to buy medicine near our hotel.","There isn''t anywhere to buy medicine near our hotel.","We can''t buy medicine anywhere near our hotel."]}]}},{"role":"translation","exercise":{"version":1,"id":"A22M6L2-HW-3-1","kind":"writing","title":"Translate into English · 3.1","instruction":"Переведи предложение на английский.","responseMode":"accepted","revealPossibleAnswers":false,"items":[{"id":"1","prompt":"Мне нужно найти место, где можно арендовать машину.","normalization":"translation","acceptedAnswers":["I need to find somewhere to rent a car.","I need to find a place to rent a car.","I have to find somewhere to rent a car.","I need to find a place where I can rent a car."]}]}},{"role":"translation","exercise":{"version":1,"id":"A22M6L2-HW-3-2","kind":"writing","title":"Translate into English · 3.2","instruction":"Переведи предложение на английский.","responseMode":"accepted","revealPossibleAnswers":false,"items":[{"id":"1","prompt":"Мы искали везде, но нигде не нашли место, где можно сделать ксерокопию.","normalization":"translation","acceptedAnswers":["We looked everywhere, but we could not find anywhere to make a photocopy.","We searched everywhere, but we could not find anywhere to make a photocopy.","We looked everywhere, but found nowhere to make a photocopy.","We looked everywhere, but could not find a place to make a photocopy.","We looked everywhere, but we couldn''t find anywhere to make a photocopy.","We searched everywhere, but we couldn''t find anywhere to make a photocopy.","We looked everywhere, but couldn''t find a place to make a photocopy."]}]}},{"role":"translation","exercise":{"version":1,"id":"A22M6L2-HW-3-3","kind":"writing","title":"Translate into English · 3.3","instruction":"Переведи предложение на английский.","responseMode":"accepted","revealPossibleAnswers":false,"items":[{"id":"1","prompt":"Здесь есть где-нибудь место, где можно записаться на приём?","normalization":"translation","acceptedAnswers":["Is there anywhere here to book an appointment?","Is there anywhere to book an appointment here?","Is there somewhere here to book an appointment?","Is there somewhere to book an appointment here?","Is there a place here where I can book an appointment?"]}]}},{"role":"translation","exercise":{"version":1,"id":"A22M6L2-HW-3-4","kind":"writing","title":"Translate into English · 3.4","instruction":"Переведи предложение на английский.","responseMode":"accepted","revealPossibleAnswers":false,"items":[{"id":"1","prompt":"Я знаю место, где можно купить лекарство.","normalization":"translation","acceptedAnswers":["I know somewhere to buy medicine.","I know a place to buy medicine.","I know a place where you can buy medicine.","I know somewhere you can buy medicine."]}]}},{"role":"translation","exercise":{"version":1,"id":"A22M6L2-HW-3-5","kind":"writing","title":"Translate into English · 3.5","instruction":"Переведи предложение на английский.","responseMode":"accepted","revealPossibleAnswers":false,"items":[{"id":"1","prompt":"Сегодня мне негде отправить эту посылку.","normalization":"translation","acceptedAnswers":["There is nowhere for me to send this package today.","I have nowhere to send this package today.","I cannot send this package anywhere today.","There is not anywhere for me to send this package today.","There is nowhere to send this package today.","there''s nowhere for me to send this package today.","there''s not anywhere for me to send this package today.","there''s nowhere to send this package today.","there isn''t anywhere for me to send this package today.","There isn''t anywhere for me to send this package today.","I can''t send this package anywhere today."]}]}}],"reference":{"version":1,"id":"A22M6L2-M06","kind":"rule-page","title":"Somewhere, anywhere, everywhere, nowhere","blocks":[{"type":"text","text":"We use somewhere when there is a place, but we do not say which place.\n\nI know somewhere to buy an envelope.","highlights":["somewhere"]},{"type":"text","text":"We often use anywhere in questions when we do not know the answer. We also use it with not when we cannot find a place. Somewhere is also possible in questions, especially when we think there is a place.\n\nIs there anywhere to rent a car near here?\nI can''t find anywhere to rent a car.","highlights":["anywhere","not","Somewhere"]},{"type":"text","text":"Everywhere means all the places we are talking about. Nowhere means no place.\n\nI looked everywhere in the hotel.\nThere''s nowhere in this hotel to make a photocopy.","highlights":["Everywhere","Nowhere","everywhere","nowhere"]},{"type":"text","text":"Nowhere already means “no place”, so do not add not. We can say the same thing with not + anywhere.\n\nThere''s nowhere to make a photocopy here.\nThere isn''t anywhere to make a photocopy here.","highlights":["Nowhere","not + anywhere","nowhere","isn''t anywhere"]},{"type":"text","text":"When we say what we want to do in a place, we use somewhere / anywhere / nowhere + to + verb.\n\nWe need somewhere to buy medicine.\nIs there anywhere to book an appointment?","highlights":["somewhere / anywhere / nowhere + to + verb","somewhere to buy","anywhere to book"]},{"type":"text","text":"These words already tell us about a place. Say go somewhere and look everywhere, without adding to or in before the place word. The to in somewhere to buy medicine goes with the action buy.\n\nWe still use look for to mean “try to find”: I’m looking for somewhere to rent a car. We can also add details: somewhere in town, anywhere near the station.","highlights":["go somewhere","look everywhere","look for","for somewhere","somewhere","anywhere"]}]},"exercises":[{"version":1,"id":"A22M6L2-M02","kind":"matching","title":"Words","layout":"picture-word","instruction":"Match the pictures with the phrases.","items":[{"id":"A","text":"A","correctId":"rent a car","assetId":"A22M6L2_WORD_A","image":"Images/A2.1/biba_boba_renting_a_car_an_adult_customer_signing_a_short-ter_56664542-f809-437f-a844-d8e196f0da0d_2.png","alt":"rent a car","imageWidth":496,"imageHeight":368},{"id":"B","text":"B","correctId":"send a package","assetId":"A22M6L2_WORD_B","image":"Images/A2.1/biba_boba_sending_a_package_an_adult_customer_placing_a_seale_91e0ce23-ed90-4b3b-a3bd-877e6e9f6533_0.png","alt":"send a package","imageWidth":496,"imageHeight":368},{"id":"C","text":"C","correctId":"book an appointment","assetId":"A22M6L2_WORD_C","image":"Images/A2.1/biba_boba_booking_a_doctors_appointment_close-up_of_a_smartp_fefe4f54-4102-41fc-a264-e2b70def47df_11.png","alt":"book an appointment","imageWidth":496,"imageHeight":368},{"id":"D","text":"D","correctId":"make a photocopy","assetId":"A22M6L2_WORD_D","image":"Images/A2.1/biba_boba_making_a_photocopy_an_adult_hand_pressing_a_button_eaae9a15-99e5-49aa-aa45-7d983f63eaa3_14.png","alt":"make a photocopy","imageWidth":496,"imageHeight":368},{"id":"E","text":"E","correctId":"buy medicine","assetId":"A22M6L2_WORD_E","image":"Images/A2.1/biba_boba_buying_medicine_at_a_pharmacy_an_adult_customer_ta_9a2cd5d8-9e77-46fe-a5d4-1a8d2a3ca574_15.png","alt":"buy medicine","imageWidth":496,"imageHeight":368},{"id":"F","text":"F","correctId":"buy an envelope","assetId":"A22M6L2_WORD_F","image":"Images/A2.1/buy-an-envelope.png","alt":"buy an envelope","imageWidth":496,"imageHeight":368}],"options":[{"id":"make a photocopy","text":"make a photocopy"},{"id":"buy medicine","text":"buy medicine"},{"id":"send a package","text":"send a package"},{"id":"book an appointment","text":"book an appointment"},{"id":"rent a car","text":"rent a car"},{"id":"buy an envelope","text":"buy an envelope"}]},{"version":1,"id":"A22M6L2-M04","kind":"gaps","title":"A busy morning","instruction":"Complete the sentences.","inputMode":"text","bank":["make a photocopy","buy medicine","send a package","book an appointment","rent a car","buy an envelope"],"items":[{"id":"1","segments":["My aunt lives in another city. I want to ",{"id":"1","answers":["send a package"]}," with her birthday present inside."]},{"id":"2","segments":["We''re only here for two days. We want to ",{"id":"2","answers":["rent a car"]}," so we can drive to the beach."]},{"id":"3","segments":["I need to ",{"id":"3","answers":["buy an envelope"]}," before I can send this letter."]},{"id":"4","segments":["The dentist can see me on Tuesday. I need to call and ",{"id":"4","answers":["book an appointment"]},"."]},{"id":"5","segments":["This is my only copy of the form, and the hotel needs a copy too. Can I ",{"id":"5","answers":["make a photocopy"]}," here?"]},{"id":"6","segments":["My cold is worse today. I need to ",{"id":"6","answers":["buy medicine"]},"."]}]},{"version":1,"id":"A22M6L2-M09","kind":"gaps","title":"Can I do it here?","instruction":"Choose the correct words.","inputMode":"select","items":[{"id":"1","segments":["There are three shops in this shopping center. I asked in all three. I asked ",{"id":"1","answers":["everywhere"],"options":["nowhere","everywhere","anywhere"]}," in the shopping center."]},{"id":"2","segments":["I didn''t find ",{"id":"2","answers":["anywhere"],"options":["anywhere","nowhere","everywhere"]}," to rent a car for less than $80 a day."]},{"id":"3","segments":["There''s ",{"id":"3","answers":["somewhere"],"options":["in somewhere","to somewhere","somewhere"]}," to buy medicine near my office. I can show you."]},{"id":"4","segments":["There''s nowhere ",{"id":"4","answers":["to buy"],"options":["buying","to buy","buy"]}," an envelope in this hotel. Let''s go to the post office."]}]},{"version":1,"id":"A22M6L2-HW-1-1","kind":"writing","title":"Translate into English · 1.1","instruction":"Переведи предложение на английский.","responseMode":"accepted","revealPossibleAnswers":false,"items":[{"id":"1","prompt":"Мне нужно где-нибудь отправить посылку.","normalization":"translation","acceptedAnswers":["I need somewhere to send a package.","I need to find somewhere to send a package.","I need a place to send a package."]}]},{"version":1,"id":"A22M6L2-HW-1-2","kind":"writing","title":"Translate into English · 1.2","instruction":"Переведи предложение на английский.","responseMode":"accepted","revealPossibleAnswers":false,"items":[{"id":"1","prompt":"Здесь есть где-нибудь место, где можно купить конверт?","normalization":"translation","acceptedAnswers":["Is there anywhere here to buy an envelope?","Is there anywhere to buy an envelope here?","Is there somewhere here to buy an envelope?","Is there somewhere to buy an envelope here?","Is there anywhere here where I can buy an envelope?","Is there a place here where I can buy an envelope?"]}]},{"version":1,"id":"A22M6L2-HW-1-3","kind":"writing","title":"Translate into English · 1.3","instruction":"Переведи предложение на